title: Palo Alto Networks: Licenses and subscriptions\nagents: paloalto_api\ncatalog: hw/network/paloalto\nlicense: GPLv2\ndistribution: checkmk-paloalto-api\ndescription:
 Monitors the licenses and subscriptions installed on a firewall ("request
 license info"), e.g. Threat Prevention, Advanced URL Filtering, WildFire,
 GlobalProtect, DNS Security or the support contract. The remaining lifetime
 is checked against lower levels (default 30/7 days); an expired license is
 CRIT (configurable). Perpetual licenses are always OK.

item:
 The license feature name.

discovery:
 One service is created per installed license.
